          "end_line": 535
        },
        {
          "id": "line-537",
          "kind": "code",
          "text": "```\ntype CancelFunc func()\n```\n",
          "parent_id": "line-535",
          "start_line": 537,
          "end_line": 539
        },
        {
          "id": "line-541",
          "kind": "paragraph",
          "text": "A CancelFunc tells an operation to abandon its work. A CancelFunc does not wait for the work to stop. A CancelFunc may be called by multiple goroutines simultaneously. After the first call, subsequent calls to a CancelFunc do nothing.\n",
          "parent_id": "line-535",
          "start_line": 541,
          "end_line": 541
        }
